            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lovestohost"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is reeeeeeallllly lime-y. Not necessarily a bad thing, but it's a whole lot o' lime! I think I'd like it better w/a healthy splash of cherry juice to tame the lime a bit. It would probably also be better w/fresh lime; my bottled lime juice creating an unappealing \"scum\" on the top of my drink. Cheers!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Loke"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It is pretty refreshing and close to a daquiri. I'm not sure that using Wray and Nephew was the best rum for the job since it adds a lot of Jamaica funk to it as well but I did just get the bottle and wanted to try it in a more neutral cocktail. This is a typical 3/5 drink, it is fine but nothing really special.",
            "datePublished": "2025-07-12T17:30:45.856Z"
